@model TeamMemberRole
@* Profile_Coordinator and Teams_Member stayed in SharedResource — Teams' Localizer is
   TeamsResource, so both call sites bind SharedLocalizer (nobodies-collective/Humans#866,
   G5 lane 4b-i). Rendered by five Teams views, Users' ProfileCard and Shell's widget
   gallery; partial lookup is by name across application parts. *@
@if (Model == TeamMemberRole.Coordinator)
{
    <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">@SharedLocalizer["Profile_Coordinator"]</span>
}
else
{
    <span class="badge bg-secondary">@SharedLocalizer["Teams_Member"]</span>
}
